{
  "_about": "panel control id -> what it does. kind: value (0..1 onto a plugin parameter), button (an action), screen. `param` is the plugin parameter id, which is the SAME string the generated parameter table carries - there is exactly one place a parameter's identity lives. TODO(new machine): replace with the machine's own controls.",
  "_why_this_file_is_checked": "The Reverb 4000's bindings.json was compiled into the binary and read by NO code at all: the real binding was a hard-coded if chain, so the file said one thing, the code did another, and nothing could notice. 68 of 189 rows were silent - 36% of the machine. tools/controls_probe.cpp checks this file against the editor's own handlers in BOTH directions, and measures each control in the audio.",
